---

## 🤝 How to contribute / extend

This project is intentionally small, so contributions are welcome.

1. Fork the repo and create a feature branch.
2. Add or improve the parser in `src/delphi_to_rust_ai_orchestrator/legacy.py`.
3. Update prompts in `src/delphi_to_rust_ai_orchestrator/prompts.py` or improve generation in `src/delphi_to_rust_ai_orchestrator/translator.py`.
4. Add tests under `tests/` and run `make test`.
5. Submit a PR with a short description of your change.

